  "details": "Im gonna be upfront here:\nEvery world i Join is populated mostly by children, either spamming items on my face, screaming into my ear or annoying other occupants of the instance. Its come to the point where i find myself joining less and less public worlds just to avoid the mess of screams and annoyances. It is impossible to have a propper conversation in a public instance without some ramdom 9 year old showing up and starting to mic-spam. I've grown tired of blocking people...\nI suggest adding a minimum age to the entirety of VRchat. Let players join, and have them verify their age with a valid ID. If you are under a certain age (for example 16) you can not join the game. \nEither that, or make it an option to have Mature only World instances.\nI find it a shame that in such a social game, i am actually avoiding public places because you can not find a single minute of peace in most worlds.",
